# FFI handlers

Follow the project skill `.cursor/skills/add-ffi-handler/SKILL.md`.

- `dispatch.go` only routes to `api/ffi/handlers`. New RPCs get a handler file and `runRPC` table tests, not a `run` closure in the table.
- Failed `provenencia_call` still returns UTF-8 `err.Error()` in `out` (not protobuf).
